 "source_selection": "Orden PEJ/160/2026 (BOA no. 25, 6 February 2026) publishes the Government of Aragón agreement of 28 January 2026 declaring the 'Campus de centros de procesamiento de datos - proyecto Epilon' in Épila, promoted by B2B Axis East 3 SLU (wholly owned by CDP Edge Solutions SLU, trading as Box2Bit), an investment of autonomous and general interest. It places the campus in the area called 'Venta Romera', cadastral polygon 20, about 33 ha in phase 1 and up to about 100 ha with later phases, and its annex I table 1 lists 50 phase-1 parcels with their total and affected areas (affected total 329,729.77 m2). All 50 were retrieved individually from the Catastro INSPIRE WFS (GetParcel). Because 30 of them are only partly affected and the affected part is not mapped in machine-readable form, the locator uses the 20 parcels whose affected area is at least 99 percent of the parcel area (167,174 m2 affected of 167,190 m2 declared), which form the core of the phase-1 land; the other 30 are kept in the facts file but not used.",
